      "variant_id": "B2-v001",
      "brief_id": "B2",
      "direction": "rugged_bumper",
      "name": "Site Sense Bumper",
      "form_language": "Chamfered slab body with four raised elastomeric bumper pods at the corners; a shallow recessed front face holds the display behind a raised protective bezel, while deep lateral ribs and a stepped grip waist give glove-friendly purchase; a dark TPE overmould band wraps the mid-body to visually and physically separate the orange shells, and all edges carry 3 mm chamfers to shed impacts and mould cleanly.",
